## 0. Hard prerequisites (fail closed)

1. Cascade INDEX + TECHNICAL-DIRECTOR read.  
2. `grounding/COMBINE-RELATE-DISCUSS.md` §3 available.  
3. Local Ollama for T3 (`thessia-scholar-v3`) — or skip T3 and human-draft only.  
4. Publication firewall (`scripts/verify-publication-safety.mjs`).  
5. English-only student surface.

